$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tombaugh V" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Noon" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle for their flags. Each base has a robust radar system making it nearly impossible to hide. However that is easily compromised by its vulnrable generator system. For the most part the bases are secure, however appearances can be decieving.";
"\n\n<f4>Map By:<f4> S_hift" @